(Intent.ACTION_VIEW, Uri.parse(url))) },\n                    border \u003d BorderStroke(1.dp, RoyalGold),\n                    modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(vertical \u003d 4.dp)\n                ) {\n                    Text(label, color \u003d SoftGold)\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Hidden Admin Trigger: Long-press on the footer version text (invisible to ordinary users)\n        item {\n            Box(\n                modifier \u003d Modifier\n                    .fillMaxWidth()\n                    .padding(top \u003d 24.dp)\n                    .combinedClickable(\n                        onClick \u003d {},\n                        onLongClick \u003d onOpenHiddenAdmin\n                    ),\n                contentAlignment \u003d Alignment.Center\n            ) {\n                Text(\n                    text \u003d \"AYUBA GOMBE DIGITAL • v1.0.0\",\n                    style \u003d MaterialTheme.typography.labelSmall,\n                    color \u003d TextSecondary.copy(alpha \u003d 0.5f)\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nprivate fun toggleAppLanguage() {\n    val current \u003d AppCompatDelegate.getApplicationLocales().toLanguageTags()\n    val next \u003d if (current.startsWith(\"ha\")) \"en\" else \"ha\"\n    AppCompatDelegate.setApplicationLocales(LocaleListCompat.forLanguageTags(next))\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 7. Secure Admin Dashboard (PIN + Firebase Auth)\n\n### `ui/screens/AdminScreen.kt`\n```kotlin\npackage com.ayubagombe.digital.ui.screens\n\nimport android.net.Uri\nimport android.widget.Toast\nimport androidx.activity.compose.rememberLauncherForActivityResult\nimport androidx.activity.result.contract.ActivityResultContracts\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.BorderStroke\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.*\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.lazy.LazyColumn\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.lazy.items\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.text.KeyboardOptions\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.automirrored.filled.ArrowBack\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.Delete\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.Lock\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.*\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Alignment\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\nimport androidx.compose.ui.platform.LocalContext\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.font.FontWeight\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.input.KeyboardType\nimport androidx.compose.ui.text.input.PasswordVisualTransformation\nimport androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.data.*\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.ui.theme.*\nimport kotlinx.coroutines.launch\n\n// Replace with Ayuba Gombe\u0027s Admin Firebase Auth credentials \u0026 chosen 4-digit PIN\nprivate const val ADMIN_PIN \u003d \"2026\"\nprivate const val ADMIN_EMAIL \u003d \"admin@ayubagombedigital.com\"\nprivate const val ADMIN_FIREBASE_PASSWORD \u003d \"ReplaceWithStrongServerPassword!\"\n\n@Composable\nfun AdminScreen(\n    repository: AyubaRepository,\n    videos: List\u003cVideoItem\u003e,\n    photos: List\u003cPhotoItem\u003e,\n    news: List\u003cNewsItem\u003e,\n    onBack: () -\u003e Unit\n) {\n    val context \u003d LocalContext.current\n    val scope \u003d rememberCoroutineScope()\n    var isUnlocked by remember { mutableStateOf(repository.isAdminSignedIn()) }\n    var pinInput by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var isAuthenticating by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\n\n    if (!isUnlocked) {\n        Column(\n            modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(24.dp),\n            verticalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.Center,\n            horizontalAlignment \u003d Alignment.CenterHorizontally\n        ) {\n            Icon(Icons.Default.Lock, contentDescription \u003d null, tint \u003d RoyalGold, modifier \u003d Modifier.size(48.dp))\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(12.dp))\n            Text(\"Administrator