el\", color \u003d TextSecondary) }\n        }\n        return\n    }\n\n    // Unlocked Admin Dashboard\n    var selectedTab by remember { mutableIntStateOf(0) }\n    var uploadProgress by remember { mutableFloatStateOf(0f) }\n    var isUploading by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\n\n    Column(modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxSize()) {\n        Row(\n            modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(12.dp),\n            horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\n            verticalAlignment \u003d Alignment.CenterVertically\n        ) {\n            IconButton(onClick \u003d onBack) {\n                Icon(Icons.AutoMirrored.Filled.ArrowBack, contentDescription \u003d \"Back\", tint \u003d RoyalGold)\n            }\n            Text(\"Admin Dashboard\", color \u003d RoyalGold, fontWeight \u003d FontWeight.Bold)\n            TextButton(onClick \u003d {\n                repository.signOutAdmin()\n                onBack()\n            }) { Text(\"Lock\", color \u003d ErrorRed) }\n        }\n\n        if (isUploading) {\n            LinearProgressIndicator(\n                progress \u003d { uploadProgress },\n                modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(horizontal \u003d 16.dp),\n                color \u003d BrightGold\n            )\n        }\n\n        TabRow(selectedTabIndex \u003d selectedTab, containerColor \u003d CharcoalSurface, contentColor \u003d RoyalGold) {\n            listOf(\"Videos\", \"Photos\", \"News\", \"Profile\").forEachIndexed { idx, label -\u003e\n                Tab(selected \u003d selectedTab \u003d\u003d idx, onClick \u003d { selectedTab \u003d idx }, text \u003d { Text(label) })\n            }\n        }\n\n        when (selectedTab) {\n            0 -\u003e VideoAdminTab(\n                videos \u003d videos,\n                onUpload \u003d { title, desc, videoUri, thumbUri -\u003e\n                    isUploading \u003d true\n                    scope.launch {\n                        runCatching {\n                            repository.uploadVideo(title, desc, videoUri, thumbUri) { uploadProgress \u003d it }\n                        }.onSuccess {\n                            Toast.makeText(context, \"Video uploaded!\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                        }.onFailure {\n                            Toast.makeText(context, \"Error: ${it.message}\", Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show()\n                        }\n                        isUploading \u003d false\n                    }\n                },\n                onDelete \u003d { id -\u003e scope.launch { repository.deleteVideo(id) } }\n            )\n            1 -\u003e PhotoAdminTab(\n                photos \u003d photos,\n                onUpload \u003d { title, uri -\u003e\n                    isUploading \u003d true\n                    scope.launch {\n                        repository.uploadPhoto(title, uri) { uploadProgress \u003d it }\n                        isUploading \u003d false\n                    }\n                },\n                onDelete \u003d { id -\u003e scope.launch { repository.deletePhoto(id) } }\n            )\n            2 -\u003e NewsAdminTab(\n                news \u003d news,\n                onPublish \u003d { title, body, uri -\u003e\n                    isUploading \u003d true\n                    scope.launch {\n                        repository.publishNews(title, body, uri) { uploadProgress \u003d it }\n                        isUploading \u003d false\n                    }\n                },\n                onDelete \u003d { id -\u003e scope.launch { repository.deleteNews(id) } }\n            )\n            3 -\u003e ProfileAdminTab(\n                onUpdateAvatar \u003d { uri -\u003e\n                    isUploading \u003d true\n                    scope.launch {\n                        repository.updateProfilePicture(uri) { uploadProgress \u003d it }\n                        Toast.makeText(context, \"Profile picture updated!\", Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show()\n                        isUploading \u003d false\n                    }\n                }\n            )\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nprivate fun VideoAdminTab(\n    videos: List\u003cVideoItem\u003e,\n    onUpload: (String, String, Uri, Uri) -\u003e Unit,\n    onDelete: (String) -\u003e Unit\n) {\n    var title by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var desc by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var videoUri by remember { mutableStateOf\u003cUri?\u003e(null) }\n    var thumbUri by remember { mutableStateOf\u003cUri?\u003e(null) }\n\n    val pickVideo \u003d rememberLauncherForActivityResult(ActivityResultContracts.GetContent()) { videoUri \u003d it }\n    val pickThumb \u003d rememberLauncherForActivityResult(ActivityResultContracts.GetContent()) { thumbUri \u003d it }\n\n    LazyColumn(contentPadding \u003d PaddingValues(16.dp), verticalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(10.dp)) {\n        item {\n            OutlinedTextField(value \u003d title, onValueChange \u003d { title \u003d it }, label \u003d { Text(\"Movie Title\") }, modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth())\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            OutlinedTextField(value \u003d desc, onValueChange \u003d { desc \u003d it }, label \u003d { Text(\"Description\") }, modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth())\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            Row(horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {\n                OutlinedButton(onClick \u003d { pickThumb.launch(\"image/*\") }) {\n                    Text(if (thumbUri \u003d\u003d null) \"Pick Thumbnail\" else \"Thumbnail Ready\")\n                }\n                OutlinedButton(onClick \u003d { pickVideo.launch(\"video/*\") }) {\n                    Text(if (videoUri \u003d\u003d null) \"Pick Video MP4\" else \"Video Ready\")\n                }\n            }\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            Button(\n                enabled \u003d title.isNotBlank() \u0026\u0026 videoUri !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 thumbUri !\u003d null,\n                colors \u003d ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(containerColor \u003d RoyalGold, contentColor \u003d ObsidianBlack),\n                onClick \u003d {\n                    onUpload(title, desc, videoUri!!, thumbUri!!)\n                    title \u003d \"\"; desc \u003d \"\"; videoUri \u003d null; thumbUri \u003d null\n                }\n            ) { Text(\"Upload Movie\") }\n            HorizontalDivider(Modifier.padding(vertical \u003d 12.dp))\n        }\n        items(videos) { v -\u003e\n            Card(border \u003d BorderStroke(0.5.dp, RoyalGold)) {\n                Row(\n                    modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(12.dp),\n                    horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.SpaceBetween,\n                    verticalAlignment \u003d Alignment.CenterVertically\n                ) {\n                    Text(v.title, modifier \u003d Modifier.weight(1f))\n                    IconButton(onClick \u003d { onDelete(v.id) }) {\n                        Icon(Icons.Default.Delete, contentDescription \u003d \"Delete\", tint \u003d ErrorRed)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nprivate fun PhotoAdminTab(\n    photos: List\u003cPhotoItem\u003e,\n    onUpload: (String, Uri) -\u003e Unit,\n    onDelete: (String) -\u003e Unit\n) {\n    var title by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var imageUri by remember { mutableStateOf\u003cUri?\u003e(null) }\n    val pickImage \u003d rememberLauncherForActivityResult(ActivityResultContracts.GetContent()) { imageUri \u003d it }\n\n    LazyColumn(contentPadding \u003d PaddingValues(16.dp), verticalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(10.dp)) {\n        item {\n            OutlinedTextField(value \u003d title, onValueChange \u003d { title \u003d it }, label \u003d { Text(\"Design / Photo Title\") }, modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth())\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            Row(horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {\n                OutlinedButton(onClick \u003d { pickImage.launch(\"image/*\") }) { Text(if (imageUri \u003d\u003d null) \"Pick Photo\" else \"Photo Ready\") }\n                Button(\n                    enabled \u003d title.isNotBlank() \u0026\u0026 imageUri !\u003d null,\n                    colors \u003d ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(containerColor \u003d RoyalGold, contentColor \u003d ObsidianBlack),\n                    onClick \u003d { onUpload(title, imageUri!!); title \u003d \"\"; imageUri \u003d null }\n                ) { Text(\"Upload\") }\n            }\n            HorizontalDivider(Modifier.padding(vertical \u003d 12.dp))\n        }\n        items(photos) { p -\u003e\n            Card {\n                Row(Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(12.dp), horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.SpaceBetween) {\n                    Text(p.title)\n                    IconButton(onClick \u003d { onDelete(p.id) }) { Icon(Icons.Default.Delete, null, tint \u003d ErrorRed) }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nprivate fun NewsAdminTab(\n    news: List\u003cNewsItem\u003e,\n    onPublish: (String, String, Uri?) -\u003e Unit,\n    onDelete: (String) -\u003e Unit\n) {\n    var title by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var body by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }\n    var imageUri by remember { mutableStateOf\u003cUri?\u003e(null) }\n    val pickImage \u003d rememberLauncherForActivityResult(ActivityResultContracts.GetContent()) { imageUri \u003d it }\n\n    LazyColumn(contentPadding \u003d PaddingValues(16.dp), verticalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(10.dp)) {\n        item {\n            OutlinedTextField(value \u003d title, onValueChange \u003d { title \u003d it }, label \u003d { Text(\"Headline\") }, modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth())\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            OutlinedTextField(value \u003d body, onValueChange \u003d { body \u003d it }, label \u003d { Text(\"Announcement Details\") }, modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxWidth(), minLines \u003d 3)\n            Spacer(Modifier.height(8.dp))\n            Row(horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)) {\n                OutlinedButton(onClick \u003d { pickImage.launch(\"image/*\") }) { Text(if (imageUri \u003d\u003d null) \"Optional Image\" else \"Image Ready\") }\n                Button(\n                    enabled \u003d title.isNotBlank() \u0026\u0026 body.isNotBlank(),\n                    colors \u003d ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(containerColor \u003d RoyalGold, contentColor \u003d ObsidianBlack),\n                    onClick \u003d { onPublish(title, body, imageUri); title \u003d \"\"; body \u003d \"\"; imageUri \u003d null }\n                ) { Text(\"Publish News\") }\n            }\n            HorizontalDivider(Modifier.padding(vertical \u003d 12.dp))\n        }\n        items(news) { n -\u003e\n            Card {\n                Row(Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(12.dp), horizontalArrangement \u003d Arrangement.SpaceBetween) {\n                    Text(n.title, modifier \u003d Modifier.weight(1f))\n                    IconButton(onClick \u003d { onDelete(n.id) }) { Icon(Icons.Default.Delete, null, tint \u003d ErrorRed) }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nprivate fun ProfileAdminTab(onUpdateAvatar: (Uri) -\u003e Unit) {\n    val pickAvatar \u003d rememberLauncherForActivityResult(ActivityResultContracts.GetContent()) { uri -\u003e\n        if (uri !\u003d null) onUpdateAvatar(uri)\n    }\n    Column(modifier \u003d Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(24.dp), horizontalAlignment \u003d Alignment.CenterHorizontally) {\n        Text(\"Upload Ayuba Gombe\u0027s Home Profile Picture\", color \u003d RoyalGold)\n        Spacer(Modifier.height(16.dp))\n        Button(\n            colors \u003d ButtonDefaults.buttonColors(containerColor \u003d RoyalGold, contentColor \u003d ObsidianBlack),\n            onClick \u003d { pickAvatar.launch(\"image/*\") }\n        ) { Text(\"Select \u0026 Upload Profile Photo\") }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Main Activity \u0026 Navigation\n\n### `MainActivity.kt`\n```kotlin\npackage com.ayubagombe.digital\n\nimport android.os.Bundle\nimport androidx.activity.compose.setContent\nimport androidx.appcompat.app.AppCompatActivity\nimport androidx.compose.foundation.layout.padding\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.Icons\nimport androidx.compose.material.icons.filled.*\nimport androidx.compose.material3.*\nimport androidx.compose.runtime.*\nimport androidx.compose.ui.Modifier\nimport androidx.compose.ui.res.stringResource\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.data.AyubaRepository\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.data.ProfileInfo\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.data.VideoItem\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.ui.screens.*\nimport com.ayubagombe.digital.ui.theme.*\n\nclass MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {\n    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {\n        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)\n        val repository \u003d AyubaRepository()\n\n        setContent {\n            AyubaGombeTheme {\n                AyubaGombeApp(repository)\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n@Composable\nfun AyubaGombeApp(repository: AyubaRepository) {\n    val videos by repository.observeVideos().collectAsState(initial \u003d emptyList())\n    val photos by repository.observePhotos().collectAsState(initial \u003d emptyList())\n    val news by repository.observeNews().collectAsState(initial \u003d emptyList())\n    val profile by repository.observeProfile().collectAsState(initial \u003d ProfileInfo())\n\n    var currentTab by remember { mutableIntStateOf(0) }\n    var activeVideo by remember { mutableStateOf\u003cVideoItem?\u003e(null) }\n    var showAdmin by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }\n\n    if (showAdmin) {\n        AdminScreen(\n            repository \u003d repository,\n            videos \u003d videos,\n            photos \u003d photos,\n            news \u003d news,\n            onBack \u003d { showAdmin \u003d false }\n        )\n        return\n    }\n\n    activeVideo?.let { video -\u003e\n        VideoPlayerScreen(video \u003d video, onBack \u003d { activeVideo \u003d null })\n        return\n    }\n\n    Scaffold(\n        containerColor \u003d ObsidianBlack,\n        bottomBar \u003d {\n            NavigationBar(containerColor \u003d CharcoalSurface) {\n                val items \u003d listOf(\n                    Triple(stringResource(R.string.nav_home), Icons.Default.Home, 0),\n                    Triple(stringResource(R.string.nav_videos), Icons.Default.Movie, 1),\n                    Triple(stringResource(R.string.nav_gallery), Icons.Default.PhotoLibrary, 2),\n                    Triple(stringResource(R.string.nav_news), Icons.Default.Newspaper, 3),\n                    Triple(stringResource(R.string.nav_about), Icons.Default.Person, 4)\n                )\n                items.forEach { (label, icon, index) -\u003e\n                    NavigationBarItem(\n                        selected \u003d currentTab \u003d\u003d index,\n                        onClick \u003d { currentTab \u003d index },\n                        icon \u003d { Icon(icon, contentDescription \u003d label) },\n                        label \u003d { Text(label) },\n                        colors \u003d NavigationBarItemDefaults.colors(\n                            selectedIconColor \u003d ObsidianBlack,\n                            selectedTextColor \u003d RoyalGold,\n                            indicatorColor \u003d RoyalGold,\n                            unselectedIconColor \u003d TextSecondary,\n                            unselectedTextColor \u003d TextSecondary\n                        )\n                    )\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    ) { padding -\u003e\n        Surface(modifier \u003d Modifier.padding(padding), color \u003d ObsidianBlack) {\n            when (currentTab) {\n                0 -\u003e HomeScreen(profile, videos, news) { activeVideo \u003d it }\n                1 -\u003e VideosScreen(videos) { activeVideo \u003d it }\n                2 -\u003e GalleryScreen(photos)\n                3 -\u003e NewsScreen(news)\n                4 -\u003e AboutContactScreen(profile) { showAdmin \u003d true }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 9. Cloud Database \u0026 Storage Security Rules\n\nDeploy these rules in the Firebase Console so **ordinary visitors can only watch/view**, and **only Ayuba Gombe\u0027s Admin UID** can upload, edit, or delete.\n\n### `firestore.rules`\n```javascript\nrules_version \u003d \u00272\u0027;\nservice cloud.firestore {\n  match /databases/{database}/documents {\n    match /{document\u003d**} {\n      allow read: if true;\n      allow write: if request.auth !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 request.auth.uid \u003d\u003d \"REPLACE_WITH_AYUBA_ADMIN_UID\";\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### `storage.rules`\n```javascript\nrules_version \u003d \u00272\u0027;\nservice firebase.storage {\n  match /b/{bucket}/o {\n    match /{allPaths\u003d**} {\n      allow read: if true;\n      allow write: if request.auth !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 request.auth.uid \u003d\u003d \"REPLACE_WITH_AYUBA_ADMIN_UID\";\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 10. Step-by-Step Guide to Build, Install \u0026 Test the APK\n\n1. **Connect Firebase:**\n   * Go to [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/) and create a project named **AYUBA GOMBE DIGITAL**.\n   * Register an Android app with package `com.ayubagombe.digital`, download `google-services.json`, and place it in `app/google-services.json`.\n   * Enable **Authentication (Email/Password)**, create Ayuba Gombe\u0027s single admin user, copy its **UID**, and paste it into `firestore.rules`, `storage.rules`, and `AdminScreen.kt`.\n   * Enable **Cloud Firestore** and **Firebase Storage**, then publish the rules above.\n\n2. **Build the APK in Android